The legal text is the Constitution of El Salvador, and the codes listed in the README, as published by the Asamblea Legislativa de la
República de El Salvador in its Índice Legislativo (https://www.asamblea.gob.sv/leyes-y-decretos).
Article 50 of the Ley de Propiedad Intelectual (Decreto Legislativo n.º 66 of 2024) allows laws to be
published, singly or in collections, faithful to the official text and without the Government's
authorisation.

<!-- acts:start -->
Decrees in the folders decreto-YYYY-NNNN/: the texts of the Asamblea Legislativa's Índice Legislativo
(https://www.asamblea.gob.sv/leyes-y-decretos/decretos-por-anios), retrieved November 2026, under the same article 50
of the Ley de Propiedad Intelectual.
<!-- acts:end -->

